# Nissan Primera P11 four-door saloon, 1996-2002.
#
# The second Primera: a shorter-wheelbase, more rounded car than the P10, built
# at Sunderland from the autumn of 1996. Pre-facelift car modelled; the
# 1999-2002 P11-144's revised nose, lamps and tail are not represented.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nissan_Primera
#
# Dimensions 4.430 x 1.715 x 1.400 m, wheelbase 2.600 m, from the English
# Wikipedia P11 dimension box. The wheelbase is 104 mm shorter than the P10's,
# which is why the two are separate shells. Mirrors take the modelled width to
# 1.879 m.
#
# Colours. No UK colour chart for the P11 was located, so the objects carry
# plain colour names: silver, red, white and blue. Weights silver 3, red 3,
# white 2, blue 2, total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 178 km/h for the 1.6, the volume fleet model. Comfort 95/473, on the
# line 330 + 1.5 x 95, a step above the P10's 90/465. Classes 1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence: October 1996 intro, retires staggered 2011-2014 on a
# twelve- to fifteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/nissan-primera-p11.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/nissan-primera-p11.dae (53 objects). References:
# citycars/references/nissan-primera-p11/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Repairs made before installation, recorded because they were completed as part
# of the first pass rather than as a second round: the first export carried a
# tall spoiler block with supports that the reference car does without, and its
# tail lamps passed through the body corner. Both were rebuilt before Stage B.
#
# Accepted deviations: the cabin is more angular than the photographed body. At
# 128 px the boot, the lamp bands and the wheelbase read correctly.

obj=citycar
name=NissanPrimeraP11(Silver)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1996
intro_month=10
retire_year=2014
retire_month=6
speed=178
length=3
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=95
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=473

